Packages/

## assets/ — the full-size hand-painted originals (~2.6MB each).
## Local-only, by the same rule as the map intermediates below: what ships is
## the 480px output under ChizuHakase/Resources/Assets.xcassets/CardArt/,
## which IS committed. The originals never enter the repo or the app bundle —
## the app target's sources are ChizuHakase/ only, so a build cannot pick
## them up even by accident.
assets/

## tmp/ — scratch space for generating card art before it is cut down.
## Same rule: originals stay out.
tmp/

## tools/ — large intermediates. PrefectureShapes.json itself IS committed
## (see CLAUDE.md §3: generated but checked in, never rebuilt at build time).
tools/japan.geojson
tools/japan_simplified.geojson
tools/node_modules/
tools/package-lock.json
tools/package.json
